#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:864
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "An arrow goes from the table holding the key to the table the key points at. %{count} of the %{total} keys go to Profile and Group, so they are hidden behind the marks P and G. Select an entity to see all its links. Its neighbours then show the column that joins them."
msgstr ""

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:566
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
